{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-2804445","kind":"blog","title":"【活动】2016年日本银行参观学习","display_title":null,"dek":null,"date":"2016-04-14","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 違う脳の勉強！","issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"works":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-2804445/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"cover":null,"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"走进平时难得参观的日本银行，见到超大型金库，还发现了能让人联想到游戏的有趣场景。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","日記"],"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 違う脳の勉強！","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/2804445.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160422162914id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/2804445.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br>\n\n\n来这里学习啦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n平时很难有机会来！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n没错，它就是・・\n\n\n<br>\n\n日本银行！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2804445/001-f15e103ff9.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2804445/001-f15e103ff9.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n一上来大家就合影留念（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后……\n\n\n居然还有伴手礼\n\n真没想到！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2804445/002-bdb9c2ab90.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2804445/002-bdb9c2ab90.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n买了\n\n纸币仙贝（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n因为结识了日本银行的人\n\n终于促成了这次学习会！\n\n我也因此\n\n来到了这里！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n因为禁止拍摄，\n\n\n\n什么都没法展示，虽然很遗憾，\n\n但还让我们看了超大型金库，\n\n已经非常满足了！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n金库……\n\n看起来\n\n厉害得简直能拿来做游戏！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这下子\n\n不做逃脱游戏，\n\n改做潜入游戏也行了（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n        然后\n    \n这里……\n\n据说以前是马匹饮水的地方！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2804445/003-ee90345335.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2804445/003-ee90345335.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n这里藏着潜入的提示！\n\n之类的（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n听说日本银行有参观游览活动，\n\n\n对这方面感兴趣的朋友一定要去看看！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（附赠）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2804445/004-87160cc774.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2804445/004-87160cc774.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure></div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br>\n\n\n勉強にやってきました！\n\n<br>\n\n\nなかなか来ること出来ない！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nその名も・・\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n日本銀行！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2804445/001-f15e103ff9.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2804445/001-f15e103ff9.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nいきなりみんなで記念撮影（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして・・・\n\nお土産があるとは\n\n意外な！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2804445/002-bdb9c2ab90.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2804445/002-bdb9c2ab90.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nお札せんべい\n\n買った（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n日本銀行の方と知り合って\n\n勉強会が実現！\n\nここに\n\n来ることが出来ました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n撮影禁止で\n\n\n\nなにも見せられないのが残念だけど\n\n超大型金庫も見せてもらい\n大満足！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n金庫・・・\n見た感じ\nゲームが作れそうな凄さ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nこりゃー\n脱出ゲームならぬ\n侵入ゲーム作れる（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n        そして\n    \nここは・・・\n昔は馬の水飲み場だったそう！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2804445/003-ee90345335.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2804445/003-ee90345335.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nここに侵入のヒントが！\nなんて（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n日本銀行見学ツアーがあるらしいので\n\n興味のある方はぜひ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（オマケ）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2804445/004-87160cc774.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2804445/004-87160cc774.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure></div>"}}